WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.376
Every single lonely night, the young boy desperately wished time would just stop.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:11.231
Then one miraculous day, his impossible wish finally came entirely true for him.

3
00:00:11.231 --> 00:00:16.679
He could suddenly freeze everything around him, including the pouring rain and people.

4
00:00:16.679 --> 00:00:22.103
At first, standing above the frozen world made him feel like an almighty god.

5
00:00:22.103 --> 00:00:27.719
He used his strange power to effortlessly win fights and avoid all emotional pain.

6
00:00:27.719 --> 00:00:33.719
But slowly, a terrifying and unexpected consequence began emerging from the shadows.

7
00:00:33.719 --> 00:00:39.143
Every single time he stopped time, someone he truly loved forgot him forever.

8
00:00:39.143 --> 00:00:44.543
Deeply desperate, he stopped time one final time and whispered his honest truth.

9
00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:50.039
He let time flow again, choosing to finally grow older instead of living forever.

10
00:00:50.039 --> 00:00:54.816
Now he embraced a beautiful life where he could finally stay with everyone.
